<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>IP Watch</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <h1>IP Watch</h1>
    <p>대상 CIDR: <%= cidr %></p>
    <p>
      마지막 정상 스캔:
      <%= lastSuccessfulScanAt ? lastSuccessfulScanAt : "없음" %>
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>전체: <%= summary.total %></li>
      <li>사용 중: <%= summary.active %></li>
      <li>과거 사용: <%= summary.inactive %></li>
      <li>미사용 추정: <%= summary.available %></li>
      <li>예약: <%= summary.reserved %></li>
      <li>할당 후보: <%= summary.allocationCandidates %></li>
    </ul>
  </body>
</html>
